    "· Sandbox: no network, no navigation · sendPrompt()/sendToolAction() available" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "· 沙箱模式:无网络、无导航 · 可用 sendPrompt()/sendToolAction()"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“Follow App Skin” derives the terminal background, foreground, and cursor from your interface skin; ANSI program colors stay standard so output stays readable. Line spacing isn't adjustable with the current terminal engine." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“跟随应用皮肤”会根据界面皮肤推导出终端的背景色、前景色和光标颜色;ANSI 程序色保持标准配色,确保输出清晰可读。当前终端引擎不支持调整行间距。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
